window.products.push({"id":418017,"name":"Zayedo 2-in-1 Dumpling & Empanada Maker Press - Perfect Wrapper Mold for Easy Homemade Dumplings & Empanadas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QAK86dgdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made from high-quality, food-grade materials, this innovative kitchen gadget is designed to help you make perfectly shaped and sized dumplings and empanadas every time. The press features a unique two-in-one design that allows you to make both types of delicious filled pastries using just one convenient tool. The press is incredibly easy to use - simply place your dough or wrapper on the base, add your filling, and then press down the top to create a perfectly formed dumpling or empanada. The device's non-stick surface ensures that your dough won't stick, while the ergonomic handle and compact size make it easy to use and store. Not only is the 2-in-1 Dumpling & Empanada Maker Press a time-saving kitchen gadget, but it's also a great way to get creative in the kitchen. Impress your friends and family with a variety of tasty, homemade dumplings and empanadas. The press is perfect for both savory and sweet pastries, so you can experiment with a wide range of flavors and ingredients. This product is perfect for anyone who loves to cook and wants to simplify the process of making homemade dumplings and empanadas. It's also a great gift idea for anyone who loves to entertain or for those who want to try their hand at creating delicious, homemade pastries. The 2-in-1 Dumpling & Empanada Maker Press is a must-have kitchen gadget for anyone who loves to cook and wants to make homemade dumplings and empanadas with ease. With its high-quality materials, innovative design, and user-friendly features, this press is sure to become a staple in your kitchen. Order now and start creating your own homemade delicacies!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QAK86dgdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zayedo","source_asin":"B0C1KHYHMS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-418017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1KHYHMS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1KHYHMS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
