window.products.push({"id":418041,"name":"Sand Ceremony Set, Black Shadow Box I Love You to The Moon with Black Writing, Shadow Box Wedding, Vow Renewal, Unity Sand Ceremony Set, Beach Wedding","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81u1EJbJbnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Many couples are choosing to include Unity Sand Ceremony on their special day. This beautiful wood 8\"x 6\" shadow box set is perfect for your ceremony. The wedding couple will find this set very easy to use. No funnel is necessary to pour the sand into the top of the shadow box. The large hinged opening flips up to allow you to not only pour your sand with ease, but also add other keepsakes such as seashells from your wedding location. The lid flips shut, allowing you to take your sand creation home and display it as a reminder of your ceremony. This set includes 2 pouring vases along with the shadow box. (Sand is not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81u1EJbJbnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Streamside Shoppe","source_asin":"B075YGPPGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-418041","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075YGPPGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075YGPPGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":418042,"name":"Bestar Universel Table Desk with Square Metal Legs, 60\" x 30\", Bark Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":178.78,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413GN5yDdTL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"High-density commercial-grade particle board work surface is compliant with TSCA Title VI and has a durable laminate finish that resists scratches, stains, and wear 1-inch thick desktop with shock resistant PVC edge detail provides a sturdy surface to work on Table Desk ideal for smaller offices Square metal legs for a modern touch Leg levelers compensate for uneven floors","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413GN5yDdTL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bestar","source_asin":"B0BW3NZ6B1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-418042","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW3NZ6B1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW3NZ6B1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":418043,"name":"Elephant 1 by Richard Wallich, 24x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LmKzVQaHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features an elephant. American impressionist Richard Wallich has spent more than 30 years honing his painting talents. He studied painting and figure drawing at the American Academy of Art in Chicago, Illinois, where he first worked in realism, but found the style too time-consuming. He soon discovered that impressionism allowed him to work much faster and more spontaneously, so that he could really immerse himself in the painting. Among other high honors, Richard was commissioned by the NFL in 1989 to paint for the Super Bowl and in 1996 he was the official artist for the Summer Olympics in Atlanta, Georgia. He has since been commissioned by several large companies such as Coca Cola, M & M Mars and American Airlines. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LmKzVQaHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00HVAI4VY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-418043","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HVAI4VY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HVAI4VY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":418044,"name":"Ice Ball Maker Mold - Flexible Silicone Ice Tray - Molds Round／skull Ice Ball Spheres， Ice Cube Molds for Cocktails & Bourbon - Reusable & BPA Free (R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-LoshokHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Ice Trays are easy to use, just let the water flow into the hole at the top of each ice ball mold and place it in the freezer，You can easily make 6 huge ice cubes at a time. The cubes are defiantly different than regular ice cubes - they are twice the size, they cool a drink faster and keep it cold for a longer period of time and they dilute it a lot less because of their large volume.Keep Your Drink Chilled For Hours Without Diluting It, Improve the taste and quality of all your favorite beverages.  DETAILED DIRECTIONS FOR USE  Step 1. Wash your trays by hand when you receive them, or place them in the dishwasher prior to your first use.  Step 2. Cover the lower tray with the upper tray and make sure that you should firmly press around each ball to make it fit tightly before filling the spheres.  Step 3. Use the funnel equipped for you to inject liquid into the mold。 Step 4. Place your trays in the freezer and let them sit for at least 6 hours. In order to prevent from creating an ice block, stack it with a heavy item.  Step 5. Twist, open, Twist, remove the ice cubes and enjoy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-LoshokHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N-A","source_asin":"B0895LRNJN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-418044","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0895LRNJN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0895LRNJN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
