window.products.push({"id":418056,"name":"Valery Madelyn 24ct 60mm Black Christmas Halloween Ball Ornaments Decorations, Shatterproof Christmas Tree Accessories Christmas Ornaments for Indoor ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JrbzN9R3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Original Design】Valery Madelyn is a retail brand with original design. The design is inspired by the Monochrome Winter Christmas style. Black and white is a timeless classic theme that goes into your modern home decor perfectly. These Christmas balls will be a fashion and unique holiday decoration in your home 【Exquisite Craftsmanship】Christmas balls Ornaments includes 3 special finishes: shiny, matte and glitter. Each Christmas ball is blow-molded and then hand-painted. Multi-finish and novelty shape ball ornaments meet all of your favorite tree decoration 【Premium Quality】Each ball is pre-tied with cap and string. These balls are made of durable and eco-friendly plastic to provide excellent shatterproof ornaments. These shatterproof Christmas tree ornaments are unbreakable practicality of plastic. Ideal for families with kids and pets 【Application】 This set of 24 Christmas ball ornaments, each measuring 2.36 inches/6cm, is suitable for use as a 6ft Christmas tree, tabletop decoration and DIY for wreaths or garlands, and also makes an excellent gift 【More Choices】Christmas Balls greatly match with black theme products like tree skirt, stocking, tree topper, wreath, garland and Christmas ornament set","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JrbzN9R3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Valery Madelyn","source_asin":"B07PP5M662","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-418056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PP5M662","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PP5M662","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":418057,"name":"JONYJ Spice Rack Organizer for Cabinet, 4-tier Spice Organizer, Expandable Seasoning Organizer, Stackable Spice Rack Wall Mount, Iron Countertop Spice","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yaUJ8GcgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨【4-TIER LARGE-CAPACITY】 If you have a ton of spices, and want them at your fingertips, this spice rack is a great option. It is a 4-tier design, measuring approximately 15.6'' L x 4.3'' W x 9.4'' H, each shelf is 1.3\" deep and 2.4\" between shelves.Spice rack organizer holds 32 4 oz spices, it can also hold larger and smaller bottles. Seasoning organizer keeps countertops clutter free, and make it easy to find herbs and seasonings while cooking ✨【DETACHABLE TIER DESIGN 】 A tiered rack in your cabinet is a great way to make the most of your space while still being able to see everything that you have. It looks simple, but this spice rack organizer for cabinet can removable to 4.5’’ to fit your cabinets perfectly. Because it ships with two units, you can stack them or place them side by side for more flexibility. The design is a clever way to minimize the amount of wasted space in any kitchen cupboard ✨【INCLINED DESIGN】 There’s a feeling of real satisfaction that comes when you open a drawer in your kitchen to reveal a perfectly organized space. This drawer spice rack organizer makes that moment possible: Its angled tiers allow you a clear view of the spices in each drawer without craning your neck. This means that even when this countertop spice rack is placed high up, you can still see what it contains.allowing you to grab the right one easily and quickly ✨【MULTIPURPOSE】 A spice rack is a highly functional item that can not only be useful in the kitchen but also hold and store many other items. This versatile holder can sit on your counter, be mounted to the wall or fit nicely in a drawer. So it can also be used as a bathroom storage rack, lounge area counter rack, pantry organizer or as a living room counter storage shelf. A spice rack can be used to store your various spices, small jars, dry food items, jelly jars, books, and cosmetics, etc ✨【STURDY & DURABLE FRAME】 This spice rack organizer for countertop is made from durable and sturdy iron and painted with a classic black color. Firmly construction and exquisite smooth surface design make it has the advantages of good load-bearing capacity, non-deformation, easy to clean, waterproof and rust-proof, etc. This countertop spice rack has a sleek, attractive appearance and well-designed. It's perfect for long-term use and home decor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yaUJ8GcgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JONYJ","source_asin":"B0C1VPCSKM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-418057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1VPCSKM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1VPCSKM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
