window.products.push({"id":418204,"name":"Mr IRONSTONE Coat Rack, Hall Tree with Shoe Bench 4-in-1 Entryway Shoe Rack with Detachable Shelf, Mudroom Garage Storage Organizer, 3.1\" L x 11.8\" W ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fiNlow5HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wood & Metal 【4-in-1 Hall Tree】The Mr IRONSTONE coat rack equips with a hanging rod, numerous hooks, an entryway bench and a detachable shoe storage rack. When you come back home, you can hang jackets, coats or bags on the hooks or the hanging rod. It is comfortable to sit on the bench, neatly hold shoes and change shoes. 【Upgrated Design】 A detachable shelf is set up with the hall tree with bench and shoe storage for taller objects. When your higher shoes are too tall to place, the detachable shelf will work up. Besides, the top bar of entryway bench with coat rack could hang scarves and umbrellas, or add coat hangers to hang up more clothes, maxing out the vertical space. 【Movable Hooks】The 9 hooks on our hall tree are removable and you could adjust them to any position you like for organizing various clothes, caps, bags and other to-go items. Adjustable foot pads at the bottom of of the coat rack with bench and shoe storage for protecting your floor. Crafted with rust-resistant metal for long-term use. 【Fast and Easy Installation】The instructions are very clear and precise, and all tools and parts are numbered, making installation a breeze. If having any problems in missing parts or instructions, product demage or other problems, please feel free to contact us. 【Product Dimension】This hall tree measures 33.1\" long by 11.8\" wide by 71.5\". Each hook can hold 6.6 pounds (about 3.0 kg) heavy winter coat, and the bench can hold 200 pounds (about 90.7 kg) for an adult sitting on to change shoes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fiNlow5HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr IRONSTONE","source_asin":"B0B1DGDD4M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-418204","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1DGDD4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1DGDD4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
