window.products.push({"id":418448,"name":"Extra-Wide Slot Toaster 2 Slice with 5 Shade Settings","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LoJJyvMFL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Are You Frequently Rushing out House for Working in the Morning and Forgetting about Making Your Breakfast? The New Upgraded iFedio 2 slice Toaster Fast Heating, Time Saving When the energy-efficient toaster heating two slices of bread to a lovely golden brown. Now, It`s High Time That You Prepared a Delicious Breakfast by Adding a Toaster for Your Family! Specific Functions: 1,The new and upgraded iFedio toasters adds two rows of cooling holes which can dissipate heat faster to protect the body and extend the service life of the toasters (This is not available in other old toasters) 2,Blue LCD Timer Display shows remaining time. 3,Multi-functional control buttons: Bagel;Defrost;Cancel. 4,High Lift Lever, safely in reach without burning fingers, easily remove smaller bread bagels waffles. 5,A slide-out crumb tray makes it easy to clean your toaster. Slice BagelToaster Specification: The Toaster Rated Power: 900W The Toaster 2 Slice Rated Voltage: 120V The Stainless Steel Toaster Slot Width:1.5\" The Bagel Toaster Size:12.7\"x7.9\"X8.2\"(LxWxH)Note  For first use, because of the machine oil, it is normal thatthere may be some chemical smell which will dissipate in the future use. We suggest toasting without bread for a few minutes during the first use of thebread toaster. To prevent electric shock ,disconnect from the mains before removing cover.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LoJJyvMFL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iFedio","source_asin":"B088CRTDBG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-418448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088CRTDBG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088CRTDBG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
