window.products.push({"id":418554,"name":"Denby Azure Rice Bowl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eXTYLZ-jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring the Mediterranean to mind with the cool aquamarine tones of Denby Azure. Add accented pieces from the Azure Coast range to bring a touch of summer to your table, whatever the weather. Anyone who owns Denby will tell you how versatile it is and how good it feels. Every piece has been designed for cooking, serving and eating food � from the �gravy rim� on our plates to the space on our saucers for biscuits. Our tableware is made for real food, not just for show. It�s for sharing, for fingers, for chopsticks, for barbeques, for kitchens�you choose. Denby can handle itself in the busiest kitchens. From the smallest cup to the biggest casserole, all our pieces can be used with confidence in the microwave, dishwasher and freezer. We've got over 5000 glazes, all harder than steel. It's taken us 180 years to get our glazes as flawless as they are, meaning our tableware washes more easily, but chips less easily. Denby is smashing stuff! Our tableware is really much harder to crack than other tableware. Each Denby piece is unique. It passes through 25 pairs of hands before reaching yours, including a test to make it as comfortable as possible to hold.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eXTYLZ-jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Denby","source_asin":"B06WD4MDWL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-418554","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06WD4MDWL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06WD4MDWL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":418555,"name":"Palace Imports 100% Solid Wood 4-Super Jumbo Drawer Chest with Lock, Mahogany. Requires Assembly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":474.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lPyzh81wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A smaller cousin of the giant five drawer Chest, it still offers impressive storage capacity with its deep four Super Jumbo Drawers. Well engineered and aesthetically pleasing, this chest will be compatible with many design ideas and interiors. Framed top prevents micro-cracking and has the appealing grooves. Metal Euro glides with safety stops offer smooth operation while plywood bottoms guarantee that even heavy items will be secured inside the drawers. The chest’s functionality is enhanced by the aesthetics of the all wood construction. 100% pine wood is beautiful, but to balance its knotty nature, wood veneer is used on large panels over solid wood boards. This gives it a silky smooth feel and a spot-free appeal. Available in three hand painted finishes it can match your interior or you can choose from other Palace Imports’ perfectly compatible furniture pieces.Overall Size: 32”w x 48.5”h x 17”d Colors: Mahogany, Honey Pine, Java Color/Wood Samples: Actual color may vary. Wood samples are mailed out for color matching upon request Paint: Lead-free compliant with the U.S. Federal Hazardous Substances Act Construction:- Solid wood panel in the center for stability- A solid wood cross tie at the bottom for added rigidity- 4 mm (5/32”) plywood back panels nailed to frame creating robust structure- Side panel Euro glides mounted at the factory - Framed top to prevent micro cracking. Grooves enhance aestheticsDrawer Details:- 4 deep large capacity super jumbo size drawers - Interior dimensions: 26\"w x 13.5\"d x 8.5\"h- Metal Euro roller glides with safety stops for smooth running, heavy loads and long lifespan- Face panels with beveled edges - 4 mm (5/32”) plywood bottoms hold substantial weight- Pocket hole butt joints. Easy assembly with screws Knobs: - Wood with tenon for tight hold - Metal antique brass sold separately  Material: 100% Pine wood. Large panels have wood veneer over solid wood  Wood Quality: Pine is kiln dried to prevent splitting and size distortion  Compatibility: Other matching pieces available in identical color and style from Palace Imports Assembly: Requires assembly. Only screwdriver/screw gun and hammer needed.Shipping:- Ships flat in one box- Factory boxes packaged into additional double-wall carton boxes in USA for best protectionEcology: “Smart Wood” sustainable tree farms are the only source of all wood as required by Brazilian lawCountry of Origin: Brazil","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lPyzh81wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Palace Imports","source_asin":"B07856TS4H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-418555","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07856TS4H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07856TS4H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
