window.products.push({"id":418565,"name":"WMF Spitzenklasse 6-Piece Knife Block Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KPE5dEopL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cooking and prepping in the kitchen just got easier with this WMF Spitzenklasse 6-piece knife block set. This set includes a knife block, utility knife, kitchen scissors, bread knife, chef's knife, and sharpening steel. The broad, strong blade of the chef's knife cuts meat, fish, or poultry with precision, and may also be used for finely chopping herbs, vegetable or nuts; simply hold the point of the blade firmly on the chopping board, while moving the cutting edge up and down. The carving knife is perfectly designed for cutting and carving raw or roasted meat. The blade ensures a firm, clean cut of the meat fibers and prevents the loss of valuable juices when carving. The bread knife features a long, strong blade with a scalloped edge, and cuts through the hard crust of bread and leaves you with neat clean slices. This knife even cuts soft fruits without crushing them, and the scalloped edge allows you to cut completely straight and to virtually draw through the food, without the blade slipping. The kitchen scissors allow for cutting herbs and foods for prep work. The sharpening steel is the perfect hand tool for bringing back the fine cutting edge of your knives. The knife block houses all the pieces attractively on the countertop while protecting the blades. WMF Spitzenklasse features knife blades made from special forged blade steel that is extremely hard, robust and rust-free, guaranteeing high cutting capability and presisting edge retention over the entire blade length. The riveted grip caps are made from durable, high quality special plastic that joins seamlessly with the blade, while the adequate bolsters help balance the knives and protect hands from accidental slips across the blade. The tang provides additional balance, making these knives great performers. Up to 45 production steps guarantee perfect workmanship with these knives, once again underscoring WMF's commitment to bringing you the highest quality products for the kitchen and home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KPE5dEopL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WMF","source_asin":"B0050XN1FI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-418565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0050XN1FI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0050XN1FI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
