window.products.push({"id":418577,"name":"Kids Tooth Fairy and Treasure Jewellery Keepsake Gift Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YPtl36i9L.jpg","description":"THERE IS NO GREATER JOY THEN THE HAPPY SMILE ON THE FACE OF A PRECIOUS CHILD! This is the Perfect Gift for Every Child: *MATERIAL AND DETAILS: Beautiful Gloss White Ceramic Box complete with Silver Hinges and a Glass Cover Top. Size – Circular Diameter approximately 3 inches by 2 inches in Height. *FOR WHAT OCCATION IS THIS GIFT SUITABLE: This is the perfect Gift for a First Tooth or Any Tooth loss, Lucky Charms, Jewellery, Birthdays, Festive Season Celebrations, Milestones, Baby Showers or Any day that you feel like bringing joy to a child as every day is a special day in a young child’s life! *SUGGESTION: Give children their daily vitamins or medicine tablets in the fairy treasure box to make this a fun routine and experience. *RECOMMENDED FOR ALL CHILDREN, BOYS AND GIRLS: Suitable for your Children, Nieces, Nephews, Grandchildren, Friend’s Birthdays, Celebrations or just to see the smile on their face! *THE POTENCIAL AND JOYS OF THIS GIFT ARE LIMITLESS: Children need stimulation which is the reason children generally get bored with regular toys rather quickly. * THE KEY DISTINCTION TO THIS GIFT: It can be used as an educational gift. It has endless advantages like assisting in the development of creativity in children through imagination and story time. * FAMILY AND BONDING TIME: Gather as a family to tell tooth fairy stories and create various other stories. A helpful HINT is to google search Tooth Fairy Stories which will give you some great ideas. * MULITPLE AND ENDLESS UES: Use as a magical storage for any valuable items from a lucky charm to Jewellery. All Children love having their very own little magical treasure box to keep or store personal belongings. *SAFE PLUS HEALTHY: Customer service and satisfaction is our number 1 priority.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YPtl36i9L.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Safe Plus Healthy","source_asin":"B07Z3XX6N8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-418577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z3XX6N8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z3XX6N8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
